    "墙体已挖好门窗洞，Blender 可直接导入": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Door and window openings are cut out; imports directly into Blender"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Con huecos de puertas y ventanas; se importa directamente en Blender"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ドアと窓の開口付き。Blender にそのまま読み込めます"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "牆體已挖好門窗洞，Blender 可直接匯入"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "墙长、层高、门窗尺寸都会标出来。可以测距、加备注和照片；用卷尺量过的墙，可以填上实测值。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wall lengths, ceiling heights and door and window sizes are labeled. Measure, add notes and photos, and enter tape-measured values."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se indican longitudes de paredes, alturas y medidas de puertas y ventanas. Mide, añade notas y fotos e introduce medidas tomadas con cinta."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "壁の長さ、天井高、ドアと窓の寸法が表示されます。計測、メモや写真の追加、メジャーで測った実測値の入力もできます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "牆長、樓高、門窗尺寸都會標出來。可以測距、加備註和照片；用捲尺量過的牆，可以填上實測值。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
