    "走到下一个房间门口再点「扫下一个房间」。中途不要退出 App，房间才能自动对齐": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Walk to the next doorway, then tap “Next room”. Keep the app open so rooms line up automatically"
          }
